  "details": "If player 1 was muted by player 2 previously when they join a world, player 2 unmuting player 1 will leave player 1 audibly muted to player 2 until either one leaves and rejoins the world. We run into this a lot during meetings, where we will mute players in VRC to hear them in Zoom, and unmuting them the next time you see them requires one of the players to rejoin to actually hear them.",
